---
---
<section id="why-fast" class="why-fast" aria-labelledby="why-fast-title">
  <div class="why-fast__container">
    <aside class="why-fast__media glass-card">
      <div class="glass-stroke"></div>
      <div class="glass-inner">
        <div class="why-fast__ratio">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
            alt="FAST production crew setting the stage"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <div class="why-fast__features">
      <h2 id="why-fast-title" class="why-fast__title">Why Brands Choose FAST</h2>
      <p class="why-fast__subhead">Production, creative, and ops aligned so your show runs clean.</p>
      <ul role="list" class="why-fast__grid">
        <li class="why-fast__card glass-card">
          <div class="glass-stroke"></div>
          <div class="glass-inner">
            <div class="why-fast__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path
                  d="M4 18.5L9.586 12.914L11.086 14.414L5.5 20H4V18.5Z"
                  fill="currentColor"
                />
                <path
                  d="M12.5 13L19.793 5.707C20.1835 5.31648 20.1835 4.68331 19.793 4.29279L17.707 2.20679C17.3165 1.81626 16.6833 1.81626 16.2928 2.20679L9 9.5V13H12.5Z"
                  fill="currentColor"
                />
                <path
                  d="M21 21H3"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.5"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="why-fast__card-title">Creative Agility</h3>
            <p class="why-fast__card-copy">Ideas fast, on brand, ready to build and approve.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="why-fast__card glass-card">
          <div class="glass-stroke"></div>
          <div class="glass-inner">
            <div class="why-fast__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="4" rx="1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <rect x="3" y="10" width="18" height="4" rx="1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <rect x="3" y="16" width="18" height="4" rx="1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <path d="M7 4V8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
                <path d="M12 10V14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
                <path d="M17 16V20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="why-fast__card-title">Technical Precision</h3>
            <p class="why-fast__card-copy">CAD, load, power, and rigging sorted before you hit site.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="why-fast__card glass-card">
          <div class="glass-stroke"></div>
          <div class="glass-inner">
            <div class="why-fast__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <path d="M12 7V12L15 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                <path d="M12 2V4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
                <path d="M12 20V22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="why-fast__card-title">Last-Minute Rescue</h3>
            <p class="why-fast__card-copy">Late brief, new VIP, weather shift. We turn it around today.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="why-fast__card glass-card">
          <div class="glass-stroke"></div>
          <div class="glass-inner">
            <div class="why-fast__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path
                  d="M4 7C4 5.34315 5.34315 4 7 4H17C18.6569 4 20 5.34315 20 7V17C20 18.6569 18.6569 20 17 20H7C5.34315 20 4 18.6569 4 17V7Z"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.5"
                />
                <path d="M8 9H9.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
                <path d="M8 12H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
                <path d="M15.5 16.5L18 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                <circle cx="15.5" cy="16.5" r="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <path d="M6 16.5L8 18.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="why-fast__card-title">Live Ops Control</h3>
            <p class="why-fast__card-copy">Showcaller, comms, and run-of-show locked to the minute.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="why-fast__card glass-card">
          <div class="glass-stroke"></div>
          <div class="glass-inner">
            <div class="why-fast__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <path d="M14 14H21V21H14V14Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="why-fast__card-title">Modular and Scalable</h3>
            <p class="why-fast__card-copy">Kits that snap together for malls, roadshows, expos, and tours.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="why-fast__card glass-card">
          <div class="glass-stroke"></div>
          <div class="glass-inner">
            <div class="why-fast__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path
                  d="M12 3L3 7V11C3 16.523 6.838 21.74 12 23C17.162 21.74 21 16.523 21 11V7L12 3Z"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.5"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                />
                <path d="M9 12L11 14L15 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="why-fast__card-title">Safe and Compliant</h3>
            <p class="why-fast__card-copy">Permits, HSE, risk, and crew briefed and audited.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
